                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As we remember the sacrifices of our veterans this Veterans\u2019 Day, we must also renew our promise to care for them when they come home.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m pleased that the Department of Veterans Affairs is investing $800 million to improve health care facilities across the country. They made the right decision choosing to use this fund for many projects at the historic Hot Springs VA Hospital, which has served generations of veterans.\n\nIt\u2019s critical that we preserve its legacy while expanding access to modern, high-quality care. Our veterans deserve the best we can offer. We owe them nothing less.",
